# Sample requests for the API. In Visual Studio, click "Send request" above each one.
# Add a request here for each new endpoint.
@Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7299

### Health check
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### All games (Step 2.1)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Accept: application/json

### One game (Step 2.1); change the id as needed
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/1
Accept: application/json


### Tiles: 1830, page 1 (Step 2.2)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles?game=25
Accept: application/json

### Tiles: yellow towns
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles?color=yellow&kind=town
Accept: application/json

### Tiles: bad input (expect 400 with three errors)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles?color=pink&kind=village&page=0
Accept: application/json

### Tile detail: generic #10 (Step 2.2)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles/60
Accept: application/json

### Tile detail: #10 (1825)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles/606
Accept: application/json

### Tile detail: #59
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles/85
Accept: application/json

### Common tiles: used by 10+ games (Step 2.8; expect 87)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles/common?minGames=10
Accept: application/json

### Common tiles: bad input (expect 400)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tiles/common?minGames=1
Accept: application/json

# ---- Phase 4: change requests. Sign in first (in the browser, or send the login request below). ----

### Sign in (sets the cookie for the requests below). Replace with a real account.
POST {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "your-password" }

### Propose a new tile (Pending for a regular user; applied at once for an admin)
POST {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Add", "tile": { "number": "T1", "color": "yellow", "definitionCode": "city=revenue:20;path=a:0,b:_0", "games": [{ "gameId": 25, "count": 2 }] },
  "reason": "Example" }

### My requests
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/mine
Accept: application/json

### Admin: review queue
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/change-requests?status=Pending
Accept: application/json

### Admin: approve request 1 (note optional)
POST {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/change-requests/1/approve

### Admin: reject request 1 (note required)
POST {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/change-requests/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Already exists as #57." }

### Admin: history of changes and imports across all tiles (all filters optional; type=Import for imports only)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/history?type=Edit&status=Approved&q=57&page=1&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json

### Admin: import history (each tobymao/18xx commit applied, with notes)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/imports
Accept: application/json

###

### Who else uses tile number 57? (signed in)
GET {{Tiles18xx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/number-check?number=57
Accept: application/json
